What are we looking for?

• You have a good command of either English, Dutch, or both, allowing you to understand procedures and work safely within a production environment;
• You enjoy working in different locations and are open to being assigned to various production facilities throughout the region;
• You are flexible regarding working hours and can work rotating shifts, including mornings, afternoons, evenings, and nights for 16 to 32 hours per week;
• You are eager to learn new skills, adapt quickly to changing tasks, and become familiar with different production equipment;
• You have an eye for detail, value quality, and actively contribute to a clean, organized, and safe workplace.
